    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "***2nd FLOOR APARTMENT / LIFT ACCESS / CONVENIENT CITY CENTRE LOCATION***\r\n\r\nKELLY BRADSHAW  are delighted to present 40 Liberty Corner, Foley Street to the sales market. 40 Liberty Corner is a second floor apartment in this modern development that is within a short walk of the main shopping thoroughfares of O'Connell Street, Henry Street and Mary Street with their fine selection of department stores, cafes and restaurants. Transport links in the area are excellent, Connolly Station and the red line LUAS close by. \r\n\r\nThis city pad is very central. On entering you are greeted by a hall, and a large storage closet, which has partial shelving and ample storage space, essential in any apartment. Off the hallway there is a large double bedroom, with fitted wardrobes, a room where light prevails throughout.\r\n\r\nOnto the large bright open living /dining area, you will be pleasantly surprised by the spacious and light flooded room. Off of the living room is the fully fitted kitchen with floor and wall tiling. The accommodation is completed by the family bathroom, which is fully tiled and benefits from a bath and overhead shower.\r\n\r\nThis apartment would suit a first time buyer or investor seeking a well located city centre apartment. The convenience of the location cannot be overstated having every conceivable amenity within walking distance. \r\n\r\nThis superb property is perfectly positioned on the doorstep of the city centre with all it is served by an extensive public transport network which includes the Connolly Station for DART and inter-city trains, Dublin Bus services and LUAS stop only seconds away. It is also surrounded by a vast array of amenities, both essential and social."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Rooms",
