        "Content": "Hall - 3.05m x 1.11m \r\n\r\n\r\nLiving Room - 5.14m x 3.01m \r\n\r\n\r\nKitchen - 3.03m x 1.9m \r\n\r\n\r\nStorage - 1.9m x 0.79m \r\n\r\n\r\nBedroom One - 3.93m x 3.61m \r\n\r\n\r\nBathroom - 2.47m x 1.63m \r\n\r\n\r\n"
